    <summary>
      <Value><![CDATA[Decaf is the quiet one on the shelf, loyal, misunderstood and mostly ignored. Perry writes it a letter.]]></Value>
    </summary>
    <tags>
      <Value><![CDATA[Beans]]></Value>
    </tags>
